note gsp/connect.om: composition seam, not a hardware launcher.
note Compose rpc/sysinfo/params/boot/arena before this unit. Firmware bytes and IOVAs are caller inputs.
note arboot constructs the arena and preboot command frames once, leaving rq counters/images attached.
note Replay queues remain host copies; later receive frames must be caller-supplied. No DMA ownership,
note queue publication, BAR notification or sequencer execution is inferred from successful encoding.
fn arboot budget ulong staticsz ulong to long
r = breset
if ne r 0
ret r
end
r = arbuild
if ne r 0
ret bfail r
end
put bstate 0 3
ret bstart budget staticsz
end
